  <div class="intro-container">

    <h2 class="intro-headline">
      I'm <span class="name">Marah Touqan</span><br>
      a designer running on<br>
      <span class="pixel">cat cuddles</span> &amp; <span class="underline">curiosity</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="intro-body">
      <p>You're here because something needs designing. Maybe it's a logo that's been side-eyed in 12 meetings. Maybe it's an app your users keep getting lost in. Maybe it's packaging that looks fine, but fine doesn't sell.</p>
      <p>I've spent <strong>13+ years</strong> untangling exactly these problems. The trick is, I listen before I open Illustrator. Your vision is the brief. My job is to translate it into something sharper, simpler, and impossible to scroll past, in <strong>Arabic, English, or both</strong>.</p>
      <p class="intro-cv"><a href="assets/Marah-Touqan-CV.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download my CV <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </div>

